    "body": "## Summary\n`divine-mobile` is seeing duplicate visible push banners. The likely failure mode is that the payload shape causes both OS-level presentation and app-side local rendering for the same incoming notification.\n\n## Assignee\n`@dcadenas`\n\n## Related Mobile Work\n- divinevideo/divine-mobile#4731\n\n## Scope\n- verify the exact FCM/APNS payload combinations currently emitted for likes, comments/replies, follows, and reposts\n- confirm whether any current payload shapes can trigger both OS-rendered and app-rendered presentation\n- adjust payload behavior if needed so mobile can avoid duplicate rendering cleanly\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- the payload contract for each notification type is documented and verified\n- any payload combinations that trigger duplicate rendering are removed or explicitly coordinated with the mobile-side gate\n\n## Done When\n- mobile and push-service agree on a payload contract that does not produce duplicate visible notifications\n",
